{"title":"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Solution_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Solution_8\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 8</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Solution_9\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 9</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Solution_10\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 10</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Punxsutawney_Phil\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Punxsutawney Phil</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> be the three roots of the equation\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/3/dd319820bf0b62935d0d87d0751f25f499d310b6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[8x^3 + 1001x + 2008 = 0.\\]\" width=\"190\" height=\"16\" />\nFind <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/3/ba3be950d2ede949b7481f8952acfa7619264c54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r + s)^3 + (s + t)^3 + (t + r)^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"222\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s formulas\">Vieta's formulas</a>, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/d/bedc4297d0cd518dd9071cccb2f0f81687d6cd51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r + s + t = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"14\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/a/2bae22f1aa60bb290d4b07dae6c755cb30f6ee9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = -r - s.$\" width=\"88\" height=\"11\" /> Substituting this into our problem statement, our desired quantity is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/6/8c67a73bfd92a63c9ee02eeab358c52d8982096a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(r + s)^3 - r^3 - s^3 = 3r^2s + 3rs^2 = 3rs(r + s).\\]\" width=\"357\" height=\"19\" /> Also by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s formulas\">Vieta's formulas</a> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/d/b0d603596c7fd47bb5f0514d5023dd1686e981c6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[rst = -rs(r + s) = -\\dfrac{2008}{8} = -251\\]\" width=\"275\" height=\"37\" /> so negating both sides and multiplying through by 3 gives our answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/f/8bfe70481e765644c37f056a5fa76683dbd07ae9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{753}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s formulas\">Vieta's formulas</a>, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/6/9967d79e5ba6c2dc7e6856a52578573bbed98b9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r+s+t = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"14\" />, and so the desired answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/f/0cf2f5dd8facf4c30af25e52939c113082742c06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r+s)^3 + (s+t)^3 + (t+r)^3 = (0-t)^3 + (0-r)^3 + (0-s)^3 = -(r^3 + s^3 + t^3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"616\" height=\"19\" />. Additionally, using the factorization\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/1/7d12c2d51a0d292289cd15114b2f2303dfbfadc5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r^3 + s^3 + t^3 - 3rst = (r+s+t)(r^2 + s^2 + t^2 - rs - st - tr) = 0\\]\" width=\"479\" height=\"19\" />\nwe have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/b/5db8c5242f816467a7a282e8ff3e57d3bfd6213a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^3 + s^3 + t^3 = 3rst$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"147\" height=\"16\" />. By Vieta's again, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/f/71f3202b63bdf9a03a90daf297ebb22f9c664812.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$rst = \\frac{-2008}8 = -251 \\Longrightarrow -(r^3 + s^3 + t^3) = -3rst = \\boxed{753}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"464\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Vieta's formulas gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/d/bedc4297d0cd518dd9071cccb2f0f81687d6cd51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r + s + t = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is a root of the polynomial, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/c/67cdfa6636283d784db660b7fba059bafa9245bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8r^3 + 1001r + 2008 = 0\\Longleftrightarrow - 8r^3 = 1001r + 2008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"394\" height=\"16\" />, and the same can be done with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/c/3ecc232c8a722d543ff7214ffb3ae39138c41b54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s,\\ t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" />. Therefore, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/7/477ffd2160f4c361a9d6e989e7afa1bbb892aa4e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}8\\{(r + s)^3 + (s + t)^3 + (t + r)^3\\} &amp;= - 8(r^3 + s^3 + t^3)\\\\ &amp;= 1001(r + s + t) + 2008\\cdot 3 = 3\\cdot 2008\\end{align*}\" width=\"556\" height=\"44\" />yielding the answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/6/896a28ce658daefc72a83139f293f8040a53924e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{753}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>Also, Newton's Sums yields an answer through the application.\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php/Newton&#39;s_Sums\">http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php/Newton&#39;s_Sums</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Expanding, you get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/d/54daefb394ddcd551b53f505d51248c6c70f45ab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r^3 + 3r^2s + 3s^2r +s^3 +\\]\" width=\"179\" height=\"16\" /> \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/5/5c5173f439bc58c08806a7cb9d214332604f6fdb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[s^3 + 3s^2t + 3t^2s +t^3 +\\]\" width=\"173\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/6/5c6b4bc4026e673dcafa1cfb3b4a35825de233ae.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r^3 + 3r^2t + 3t^2r +t^3\\]\" width=\"158\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/d/c5d4301c3f01aa00ac9fbaf09c5221411b872f0a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= 2r^3 + 2s^3 + 2t^3 + 3r^2s + 3s^2r + 3s^2t + 3t^2s + 3r^2t + 3t^2r\\]\" width=\"463\" height=\"16\" />\nThis looks similar to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/4/054ee545e469df5ff4e72b7a53da99f1cd334915.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r+s+t)^3 = r^3 + s^3 + t^3 + 3r^2s + 3s^2r + 3s^2t + 3t^2s + 3r^2t + 3t^2r + 6rst$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"587\" height=\"19\" />\nSubstituting:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/a/0ea0ca7e41816bfe97fea91b0f0517e91ae58956.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(r+s+t)^3 - 6rst + r^3+s^3+t^3 = (r + s)^3 + (s + t)^3 + (t + r)^3\\]\" width=\"477\" height=\"19\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/6/9967d79e5ba6c2dc7e6856a52578573bbed98b9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r+s+t = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"14\" />, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/7/0c7bd2a1c704cb5a81ea0b3db61b615cc1c8e465.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(r+s)^3 + (s+t)^3 + (t+r)^3 = (0-t)^3 + (0-r)^3 + (0-s)^3 = -(r^3 + s^3 + t^3)\\]\" width=\"517\" height=\"19\" />\nSubstituting, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/1/6214d11c39e8df9ef2098ff83748f23776ff54ae.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(r+s+t)^3 - 6rst + r^3+s^3+t^3 =  -(r^3 + s^3 + t^3)\\]\" width=\"398\" height=\"19\" />\nor, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/7/b173fa11388fb92cab21f0e6e275c5b39daafbbf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0^3 - 6rst + r^3+s^3+t^3 =  -(r^3 + s^3 + t^3) \\implies 2(r^3 + s^3 + t^3) = 6rst\\]\" width=\"482\" height=\"19\" />\nWe are trying to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/d/f6d21e9252feb9e26f8715be2ebc6bdf3f221e4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-(r^3 + s^3 + t^3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"117\" height=\"19\" />.\nSubstituting:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79476d88cda3993ab7e66ff78c48474a8b75a4c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-(r^3 + s^3 + t^3) = -3srt = \\frac{-2008*3}{8} = \\boxed{753}.\\]\" width=\"360\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/f/88fc01fad2998061c05e63270bd2c1129dbae818.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r+s)^3+(s+t)^3+(t+r)^3=-(r^3+s^3+t^3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"365\" height=\"19\" /> and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/b/1cbfabaa1e5c03df1e9ca28e491fdb08f9c5ddb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=8x^3+1001x+2008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"213\" height=\"19\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/9/fe9156413e5cee55208c3985c4903a6e0a2cc6c8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(r)+f(s)+f(t)=8(r^3+s^3+t^3)+1001(r+s+t)+6024=8(r^3+s^3+t^3)+6024=0.\\]\" width=\"625\" height=\"19\" /> Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/4/de4a555752076226215d2407d65e79e9b7a5681a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^3+s^3+t^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"89\" height=\"16\" /> and negating the result yields the answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/f/8bfe70481e765644c37f056a5fa76683dbd07ae9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{753}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Here by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s formulas\">Vieta's formulas</a>:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/6/9967d79e5ba6c2dc7e6856a52578573bbed98b9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r+s+t = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"14\" /> --(1)\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/1/801fb2ba3bae75cbc5fbae9a58c730d8c19be2d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$rst = \\frac{-2008}{8} = -251$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"167\" height=\"37\" /> --(2)\n</p><p>By the factorisation formula:\nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/1/521e621baec4cc59f06d0d11e42fbf68e2c8de53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = r+s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/f/58fb7f5352b9a35469c796e1b0251ce498e865f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = s+t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/d/a5d58c8f7ef9cc2c3e2fc74076280c25df7a7923.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = t+r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/a/a0a75c14b387ec056490644d463bf9f6c932122f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3+b^3+c^3-3abc = (a+b+c)(a^2+b^2+c^2-ab-bc-ca) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"515\" height=\"21\" /> (By (1))\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/3/6d325ecefb6bafd4bd07404730055e1a778333cd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^3+b^3+c^3 = 3abc = 3(r+s)(s+t)(t+r) = 3(-t)(-r)(-s) = 3[-(-251)] = \\boxed{753}.\\]\" width=\"621\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_7\">Solution 7</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let's construct a polynomial with the roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/7/297286be70401373919e8e3364d7c49368fcd9fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r+s), (s+t),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/b/f2babeb0910c67c381ff1ba699a2610d0a3d5b10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(t+r)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>sum of the roots:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/d/3adc8c06ed09b39d4eef32115d68057484439807.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2(r+s+t)=2\\cdot0=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"199\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>pairwise product of the roots:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/0/5d0426b25aa3d73a9ebecf0278bdf86ecfdd4056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r+s)(s+t)+(s+t)(t+r)+(t+r)(r+s)=r^2+s^2+t^2+3(rs+st+tr)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"608\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/b/13babb11c3561b761d17bd9eba8b5d57239ce019.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=(r+s+t)^2+rs+st+tr=0+\\frac{1001}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"317\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>product of the roots:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e9051fb0b7287acaf634741af7a2f12cdb4f196.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r+s)(s+t)(t+r)=r^2t+r^2s+s^2r+s^2t+t^2r+t^2s+3rst$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"486\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/a/49a4ca84e53d145b6c4a5e9db5341c1b3703436b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=(rs+st+tr)(r+s+t)-3rst+2rst=-rst=-\\frac{2008}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"457\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>thus, the polynomial we get is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/e/ace5bb077d44ae4b80be6af7d39cdb19a14ea8a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3+\\frac{1001}{8}x+-\\frac{2008}{8}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"203\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/7/297286be70401373919e8e3364d7c49368fcd9fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r+s), (s+t),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/b/f2babeb0910c67c381ff1ba699a2610d0a3d5b10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(t+r)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" /> are roots of this polynomial, we know that (using power reduction)\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/f/8df7816263629cf5cdc1909d00e95f30b6683c31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r+s)^3+\\frac{1001}{8}(r+s)-\\frac{2008}{8}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"272\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/c/d6c2b28c1cb20945a6b11d49056a70ee443f2dc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(s+t)^3+\\frac{1001}{8}(s+t)-\\frac{2008}{8}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"268\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/a/54ab68678473968db4d9b1653d4f33063ed6f11b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(t+r)^3+\\frac{1001}{8}(t+r)-\\frac{2008}{8}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"268\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>adding all of the equations up, we see that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/4/484f293f8ace3f45794a637ff2d1492df839fb0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r+s)^3+(s+t)^3+(t+r)^3=3\\cdot\\frac{2008}{8}-\\frac{1001}{8}(2r+2s+2t)=251(3)+0=\\boxed{753}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"652\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_8\">Solution 8</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 8\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We want to find what is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f371be1f2e07cdc8e8ccf9d95d8c17d2d8487580.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-(r^3+s^3+t^3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"117\" height=\"19\" /> which reminds us of Newton sum. So we can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/3/9935de568a42662b7fe704d2ea7ada6a06c73094.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8S_3+0\\cdot S_2+1001\\cdot S_1+3\\cdot 2008=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"297\" height=\"17\" /> Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/4/d04ec99b2c4eea758b597f943540b267cb6d1c7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" /> so it is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/2/8a275450ca977263d61a7cf5a5d5d7ad058f22ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_3=-\\frac{2008\\cdot 3}{8}=-753$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"187\" height=\"38\" />, the desired answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/6/896a28ce658daefc72a83139f293f8040a53924e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{753}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~bluesoul\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_9\">Solution 9</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 9\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This solution uses Vietas, as with everyone else's solution.\nExpanding the expression we get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/2/7d22c7fd329714d5ce7c404fe991bba7be7b2ce2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(r+s)^3+(s+t)^3+(t+r)^3 = r^3+3r^2s+3rs^2+\\dots +3s^2t+3ts^2+t^3\\]\" width=\"477\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Seeing the cubes, we try to find a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/6/a462b828c42d98364fba3931808a37280d4b8601.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r+s+t)^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"21\" /> and upon doing so, we get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/e/a4e1aeea5cef12b95d69426847c62af6073b9266.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(r+s)^3+(s+t)^3+(t+r)^3=(r+s+t)^3-6rst+(r^3+s^3+t^3)\\]\" width=\"516\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Recall that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/a/c2afdb9b5c580b5f0e282f13515910be5f913290.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3+b^3+c^3-3abc=(a+b+c)(a^2+b^2+c^2-ab-bc-ca)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"478\" height=\"19\" />. Thus, we get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/5/425e797b9c41318454c582eb2dcdacd6e5bcc31e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(r+s)^3+(s+t)^3+(t+r)^3=(r+s+t)^3-3rst+(r+s+t)(r^2+s^2+t^2-rs-st-tr)\\]\" width=\"584\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/b/b3b5fa4be49c601b676217fdc16c0760824797fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r+s+t)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"118\" height=\"20\" /> we get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/d/1dd2dd86b815b7c5121c8eeba9aa41b5aab75a0b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(r+s)^3+(s+t)^3+(t+r)^3=0-3rst+0=-3\\cdot -251=\\boxed{753}\\]\" width=\"479\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~firebolt360\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_10\">Solution 10</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 10\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/0/1f0d2cdb2e426ce59ca5135bc9a64dd15ca94314.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8x^3+1001x+2008=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"190\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>We want to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/8/7387ac83aadde8b79f568018b5aace00ef8e75d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r+s)^3+(s+t)^3+(t+r)^3.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"230\" height=\"21\" /> Let's call this result n.\n</p><p>From vieta's formulas, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/5/0f502794495837250fa897227de9f8afd22cf274.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r+s+t=-0/8=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"169\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/1/1c19e00e5b0c02a8c844b9aedfb6bf1e21aa7c73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$rs+st+tr=1001/8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"173\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/3/763731211972a2a24c5926c8a8483432f0d79b9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$rst=-2008/8=-251.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"189\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Expanding and rearranging gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/7/a9700edcfe90744ec9ab7cf69917e73c312bb499.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=(r+s)^3+(s+t)^3+(t+r)^3=r^3+3r^2s+3rs^2+s^3+s^3+3s^2t+3st^2+t^3+t^3+3t^2r+3tr^2+r^3=2r^3+2s^3+3r^2s+3rs^2+3s^2t+3st^2+3t^2r+3tr^2=3(r^3+s^3+t^3-(r^2s+rs^2+s^2t+st^2+t^2r+tr^2))-(r^3+s^3+t^3)=3((r+s+t)(r^2+s^2+t^2))-((r+s+t)^3-3(r^2s+rs^2+s^2t+st^2+t^2r+tr^2)-6rst)=3(r+s+t)((r+s+t)^2-2(rs+st+tr))-((r+s+t)^3-3(r^2s+rs^2+s^2t+st^2+t^2r+tr^2)-6rst)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1110\" height=\"61\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/b/18ba0ac31930bec321b69d05b66033d17c1d702f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=r^2s+rs^2+s^2t+st^2+t^2r+tr^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"287\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/c/79ce0bf0b097f636cb059926a9cbb114f4c79b64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=r^2s+rs^2+s^2t+st^2+t^2r+tr^2=(r+s+t)(r^2+s^2+t^2)-(r^3+s^3+t^3)=(r+s+t)((r+s+t)^2-2(rs+st+tr))-((r+s+t)^3-3k-6rst)=(0)(0^2-2(1001/8))-(0^3-3k-6(-251))=0-(0-3k+1506)=3k-1506$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>Solving gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/1/4c1d66d5f1d23675486d43054520c4557e497a7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=753$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/a/d1a0cf44e232aead3325dfe0dd67588017c263ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=3(r+s+t)((r+s+t)^2-2(rs+st+tr))-((r+s+t)^3-3(r^2s+rs^2+s^2t+st^2+t^2r+tr^2)-6rst)=3(0)(0^2-2(1001/8))-(0^3-3k-6(-251))=0-(0-3(753)+1506)=753$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/a/51a8a48b6418d0d5e24e20762caf378a9d24f3e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$753.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Also note that this is the only solution that still would have worked effectively if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/4/3b4d8cb6aa374535cea16c712b70c8f6ba8155ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r+s+t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"67\" height=\"13\" /> was nonzero.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Punxsutawney_Phil\">Video Solution by Punxsutawney Phil</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Punxsutawney Phil\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6mYZYh9gJBs\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6mYZYh9gJBs</a>\n(unavailable)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II\" title=\"2008 AIME II\">2008 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2008\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 AIME II Pro